abstract: >-
  WaveHolo's off-axis digital holography pipeline pointed at a
  telescope pupil: a distant star through a circular pupil with
  Zernike aberrations, recorded as an off-axis hologram and
  reconstructed, with the pupil plane found by aperture contrast
  and the wavefront compared against injected ground truth.
  Synthetic only; no real telescope claim.
